<div id="report-chart-data" hidden data-chart="<%=JSON.stringify({points:chart.points.map(({label,total,orders})=>({label,total,orders})),products:report.products.slice(0,5),categories:report.categories})%>"></div>
<section class="report-panel trend-chart"><div class="chart-heading"><div><span class="eyebrow">SALES OVER TIME</span><h2>Order value trend</h2></div><span class="chart-unit">MYR · <%=chart.monthly?'Monthly':'Daily'%></span></div><p>Includes shipping and tax. Periods without orders are shown as zero.</p><div class="chartjs-frame"><canvas id="sales-chart" role="img" aria-label="Order value trend in MYR. Exact values are in the daily order table below.">Order value data is available in the daily order table below.</canvas></div><p class="field-hint">Hover or tap a point for its value. Full data tables are below.</p></section>
<div class="report-grid"><section class="report-panel"><span class="eyebrow">MOST POPULAR</span><h2>Top 5 products</h2><p>Units sold in the selected period.</p><div class="chartjs-frame chartjs-small"><canvas id="products-chart" role="img" aria-label="Top five products by units sold. Exact values are in the best-selling products table below."></canvas></div></section><section class="report-panel"><span class="eyebrow">REVENUE MIX</span><h2>Category share</h2><p>Product revenue only, excluding shipping and tax.</p><div class="chartjs-frame chartjs-small"><canvas id="category-chart" role="img" aria-label="Category revenue share. Exact values are listed in category performance below."></canvas></div></section></div><noscript><p class="field-hint">Enable JavaScript to see charts. All report values remain available in the tables below.</p></noscript>